@startuml Kurangi Stok dari Menu
actor Chef
boundary "Halaman Dapur (Blade)" as UI
control "JavaScript (Fetch API)" as JS
control "Recipe Controller (Laravel)" as BE
database "Database (MySQL)" as DB

Chef -> UI : Klik Kartu Resep (cth: Baguette)
activate UI

UI -> JS : bukaResep(id)
activate JS
JS -> BE : GET /api/recipes/{id}
BE -> DB : Query detail resep & komposisi
DB --> BE : Data Resep & Bahan
BE --> JS : JSON Data
JS --> UI : Tampilkan Modal Detail & Bahan
deactivate JS

Chef -> UI : Input Jumlah Porsi
Chef -> UI : Klik "Mulai Produksi"
activate JS

JS -> BE : POST /api/recipes/{id}/execute\n[Body: portions]
activate BE

BE -> DB : Cek ketersediaan stok semua bahan terkait
activate DB
DB --> BE : Hasil Cek Stok
deactivate DB

alt Ada bahan yang kurang
    BE --> JS : Return JSON Error (Stok bahan X tidak cukup)
    JS -> UI : tampilToast('error', pesan)
else Semua bahan cukup
    BE -> DB : Start Transaction
    activate DB
    
    DB -> DB : Update qty di tabel products\n(Kurangi sesuai takaran)
    DB -> DB : Insert ke tabel stock_logs\n(type: 'recipe_reduce', untuk tiap bahan)
    
    DB --> BE : Commit Transaction (Success)
    deactivate DB

    BE --> JS : Return JSON (success: true, message)
    
    JS -> UI : tutupResep()
    JS -> UI : tampilToast('success', message)
    UI --> Chef : Muncul Toast OREN Sukses

    JS -> JS : window.location.reload() (Jeda 1.5 detik)
    UI --> Chef : Halaman Refresh (Stok Terupdate)
end

deactivate BE
deactivate JS
deactivate UI
@enduml